{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep content. Diverse missions. Thoughtful design. Welcome to ContractVille.<br>In Port Town, you start your journey with almost no money. Take on some work from the neighborhood and earn a modest income.\u00a0Together with your friends, establish a business with <strong>up to 4</strong> members.\u00a0Enjoy the <strong>open world</strong> in Creek Harbour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/2c62eabedb8a16c7f3ecedd08fbeee64.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/2c62eabedb8a16c7f3ecedd08fbeee64.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/d76da632fa944fc729eef404979efb99.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/d76da632fa944fc729eef404979efb99.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept a contract mission or buy a ruin. Engage in construction across small, medium, and large plots. Pick up your sledgehammer and get to work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When life gets too stressful, sometimes all you need is a sledgehammer and a wall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up trash, extract broken furniture from the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the first step in a complete renovation of the land.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/fb1993d4d8aa4a1dd8b94c2e322a5bff.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/fb1993d4d8aa4a1dd8b94c2e322a5bff.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/fbbdb0764be18a325ba7f27ed539ef1d.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/fbbdb0764be18a325ba7f27ed539ef1d.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how many floors your house will have based on the size of your land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your dream house using the planner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the walls, windows, exterior doors, and interior doors as you wish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Categorize the areas and separate the rooms.\u00a0Choose the size of each room and define its function \u2014 bedroom, kitchen, living room, or something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/685d3118f736d948b9f4c49058010507.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/685d3118f736d948b9f4c49058010507.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/26a6e930c9197b55bd6e239ca498298f.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/26a6e930c9197b55bd6e239ca498298f.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig the soil with your shovel, prepare the cement, add reinforcement, and lay the bricks and tiles.\u00a0Then move on to the interior construction of the house. Plaster, paint.\u00a0Lay the floor tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many choices and customizations await you. You can paint the walls the color you want and choose the pattern of the floor tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your home's appearance from top to bottom \u2014 roof, balcony, porch, and even the garden. It\u2019s all <i>in your hands</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete entire construction projects from the ground up. Once finished, furnish and decorate them to your taste \u2014 or put them up for auction and turn your work into profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/e715d124d19e1a20ae6031fa2e8ab05b.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/e715d124d19e1a20ae6031fa2e8ab05b.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/943e11fb49f7f80408f41f7acb9343e1.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/943e11fb49f7f80408f41f7acb9343e1.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can decorate every inch of the house and garden as you wish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hundreds of decoration products and furniture suitable for every room. You will get design points for the decorations you make and will allow you to earn extra money. You can even customize the details of almost every piece of furniture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you receive a decoration task as part of a contract mission, you'll be tasked with renovating a house full of outdated items. These items can then be sold at the Pawn Shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/1aad1fac547fcda7a85e9d5b449d3065.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/1aad1fac547fcda7a85e9d5b449d3065.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/3a8f8f7a2f14c4a8e0bc7a75e9ab5de4.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/3a8f8f7a2f14c4a8e0bc7a75e9ab5de4.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After earning a small amount of money, buy your office and sell dozens of upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your company with the improvements you make. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your office from an almost empty plot of land into a highly equipped business center. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy many developments such as wind turbines, a warehouse, a garage, a basketball court, a cafeteria, and a pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/9df9b53c73ef1f006fc696ff653f7ae6.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/9df9b53c73ef1f006fc696ff653f7ae6.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/a33c9c427ef93088756e4b3861b938f5.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/a33c9c427ef93088756e4b3861b938f5.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op is not for you? If you are a solo player, you can hire workers if you want. <i>(It's also possible if you're playing co-op.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After setting up your company, you can build your own construction crew by purchasing the Worker Cabins upgrade in your office. Pay workers a daily wage and give them commands to use them in your mission areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/be793fc63491994635c0f6b87871c1da.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/be793fc63491994635c0f6b87871c1da.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mail Missions:</strong>\u00a0Accept jobs in your neighborhood and as you complete a task, a new mail mission will appear on your tablet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contract Missions:</strong>\u00a0Choose between Demolish, Decorate, Logistic and Build missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Green:</strong>\u00a0Use the Go Green App on your tablet to complete various tasks and earn rewards. Green the environment by planting trees, plants, and seeds. Hang eco-friendly posters on the walls. Inform people about protecting nature. Advertise the vehicles in the game world. Rescue animals trapped in trash and clean up the forest. Fight the vandals and bring them to justice. Build a water mill to clean the river.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxi:</strong>\u00a0Become a taxi driver with your own vehicle. Take passengers to their destination and earn extra money. Also, if you want to get to a location quickly, you can call a taxi and be a passenger yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cargo:</strong>\u00a0Deliver cargo boxes from warehouses to designated locations. But be careful; some of them might be fragile!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle:</strong>\u00a0Recycle the garbage you collect in the recycling factory and earn extra income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars:\u00a0</strong>In ContractVille, dozens of different vehicles await you. At the city\u2019s three car galleries, you can explore and purchase a wide range of options\u2014including electric vehicles, sports cars, high-capacity models, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotes &amp; Jokes:\u00a0</strong>You\u2019ll also find plenty of ways to enjoy yourself with your friends.\u00a0Slap your friend, horn at them, or throw whoopie cussion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Skills:</strong>\u00a0As you gain experience, you gain skill points and can choose which skills or tools to focus on. Having colleagues specialize in different subjects can make your job even easier.\u00a0For example, while your friend can demolish faster, you can improve your tech skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/95d0ead4f6e10a0ea1e819de342b528b.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/95d0ead4f6e10a0ea1e819de342b528b.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/aff7783d924e06204bfeff189125ebf0.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/aff7783d924e06204bfeff189125ebf0.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part of our Discord community with over 10,000 members! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your suggestions and complaints about the game, help us improve the game by reporting bugs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in events and share what you have been doing with other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you encounter a problem, seek support from our team and quickly access possible solutions.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to CreekHarbour!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/36162eb1ddf6ca7088116c08724d840aa7431be7.jpg"},{"name":"Home, my sweet home, kind of.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/c7d63569e03bcb81ae9bcb32741b337af3b32597.jpg"},{"name":"New Venture","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/ba1bd8b2b117298f231bd6f4cad65c62eb7e8258.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/1999c6a68e50722293f5e97a053644c2dace5d04.jpg"},{"name":"First Wheels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/7f3e1eb7dfcece531c013e6c82448cbfff4bc3ad.jpg"},{"name":"Fuelled-Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/574a9c67ef01fda27976417b1a0b3ce9f532c5fe.jpg"},{"name":"Captain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/c17d712941fe4dbc54a2b886e43ad2da861bcbcb.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/e83ad8ceb6f054abf6522e1b0f813d37779fbdbc.jpg"},{"name":"Wealth Owner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/cefb83bc623133f3e78a32d1957e6fbe601c38db.jpg"},{"name":"Landowner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698780/03db5f801a35b0722e18c491a2671a2394bf0ea4.jpg"}],"total":77},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698780?t=1770986902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/eb2c60ea975a450231bdd4452c0c31220b6e6d60/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770986902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/9223f2825e17ca78465c8d973f43e9458db0cb0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770986902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/9223f2825e17ca78465c8d973f43e9458db0cb0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770986902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep content. Diverse missions. Thoughtful design. Welcome to ContractVille.<br>In Port Town, you start your journey with almost no money. Take on some work from the neighborhood and earn a modest income.\u00a0Together with your friends, establish a business with <strong>up to 4</strong> members.\u00a0Enjoy the <strong>open world</strong> in Creek Harbour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/2c62eabedb8a16c7f3ecedd08fbeee64.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/2c62eabedb8a16c7f3ecedd08fbeee64.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/d76da632fa944fc729eef404979efb99.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/d76da632fa944fc729eef404979efb99.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept a contract mission or buy a ruin. Engage in construction across small, medium, and large plots. Pick up your sledgehammer and get to work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When life gets too stressful, sometimes all you need is a sledgehammer and a wall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up trash, extract broken furniture from the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the first step in a complete renovation of the land.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/fb1993d4d8aa4a1dd8b94c2e322a5bff.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/fb1993d4d8aa4a1dd8b94c2e322a5bff.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/fbbdb0764be18a325ba7f27ed539ef1d.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/fbbdb0764be18a325ba7f27ed539ef1d.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how many floors your house will have based on the size of your land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your dream house using the planner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the walls, windows, exterior doors, and interior doors as you wish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Categorize the areas and separate the rooms.\u00a0Choose the size of each room and define its function \u2014 bedroom, kitchen, living room, or something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/685d3118f736d948b9f4c49058010507.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/685d3118f736d948b9f4c49058010507.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/26a6e930c9197b55bd6e239ca498298f.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/26a6e930c9197b55bd6e239ca498298f.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig the soil with your shovel, prepare the cement, add reinforcement, and lay the bricks and tiles.\u00a0Then move on to the interior construction of the house. Plaster, paint.\u00a0Lay the floor tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many choices and customizations await you. You can paint the walls the color you want and choose the pattern of the floor tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your home's appearance from top to bottom \u2014 roof, balcony, porch, and even the garden. It\u2019s all <i>in your hands</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete entire construction projects from the ground up. Once finished, furnish and decorate them to your taste \u2014 or put them up for auction and turn your work into profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/e715d124d19e1a20ae6031fa2e8ab05b.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/e715d124d19e1a20ae6031fa2e8ab05b.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/943e11fb49f7f80408f41f7acb9343e1.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/943e11fb49f7f80408f41f7acb9343e1.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can decorate every inch of the house and garden as you wish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hundreds of decoration products and furniture suitable for every room. You will get design points for the decorations you make and will allow you to earn extra money. You can even customize the details of almost every piece of furniture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you receive a decoration task as part of a contract mission, you'll be tasked with renovating a house full of outdated items. These items can then be sold at the Pawn Shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/1aad1fac547fcda7a85e9d5b449d3065.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/1aad1fac547fcda7a85e9d5b449d3065.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/3a8f8f7a2f14c4a8e0bc7a75e9ab5de4.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/3a8f8f7a2f14c4a8e0bc7a75e9ab5de4.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After earning a small amount of money, buy your office and sell dozens of upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your company with the improvements you make. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your office from an almost empty plot of land into a highly equipped business center. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy many developments such as wind turbines, a warehouse, a garage, a basketball court, a cafeteria, and a pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/9df9b53c73ef1f006fc696ff653f7ae6.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/9df9b53c73ef1f006fc696ff653f7ae6.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/a33c9c427ef93088756e4b3861b938f5.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/a33c9c427ef93088756e4b3861b938f5.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op is not for you? If you are a solo player, you can hire workers if you want. <i>(It's also possible if you're playing co-op.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After setting up your company, you can build your own construction crew by purchasing the Worker Cabins upgrade in your office. Pay workers a daily wage and give them commands to use them in your mission areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/be793fc63491994635c0f6b87871c1da.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/be793fc63491994635c0f6b87871c1da.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mail Missions:</strong>\u00a0Accept jobs in your neighborhood and as you complete a task, a new mail mission will appear on your tablet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contract Missions:</strong>\u00a0Choose between Demolish, Decorate, Logistic and Build missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Green:</strong>\u00a0Use the Go Green App on your tablet to complete various tasks and earn rewards. Green the environment by planting trees, plants, and seeds. Hang eco-friendly posters on the walls. Inform people about protecting nature. Advertise the vehicles in the game world. Rescue animals trapped in trash and clean up the forest. Fight the vandals and bring them to justice. Build a water mill to clean the river.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxi:</strong>\u00a0Become a taxi driver with your own vehicle. Take passengers to their destination and earn extra money. Also, if you want to get to a location quickly, you can call a taxi and be a passenger yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cargo:</strong>\u00a0Deliver cargo boxes from warehouses to designated locations. But be careful; some of them might be fragile!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle:</strong>\u00a0Recycle the garbage you collect in the recycling factory and earn extra income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars:\u00a0</strong>In ContractVille, dozens of different vehicles await you. At the city\u2019s three car galleries, you can explore and purchase a wide range of options\u2014including electric vehicles, sports cars, high-capacity models, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotes &amp; Jokes:\u00a0</strong>You\u2019ll also find plenty of ways to enjoy yourself with your friends.\u00a0Slap your friend, horn at them, or throw whoopie cussion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Skills:</strong>\u00a0As you gain experience, you gain skill points and can choose which skills or tools to focus on. Having colleagues specialize in different subjects can make your job even easier.\u00a0For example, while your friend can demolish faster, you can improve your tech skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/95d0ead4f6e10a0ea1e819de342b528b.avif?t=1770986902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras_big/95d0ead4f6e10a0ea1e819de342b528b.avif?t=1770986902 width=800 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/aff7783d924e06204bfeff189125ebf0.poster.avif?t=1770986902\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/extras/aff7783d924e06204bfeff189125ebf0.webm?t=1770986902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part of our Discord community with over 10,000 members! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write your suggestions and complaints about the game, help us improve the game by reporting bugs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in events and share what you have been doing with other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you encounter a problem, seek support from our team and quickly access possible solutions.</p>","developers":["MYM Games Studios"],"dlc":[4376710,4207210,4075310,3969000],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698780/123c178d59b4141e64072d768e775ae20bd1794c/header.jpg?t=1770986902","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Requires agreement to a 3rd-party EULA ContractVille EULA","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"m